    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĭnuscŭlus</span></b> , a,
		um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj.
				dim.</i> [1. minus], <i>rather less, rather
			small</i> (class.): ostium, Poët. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 3, 12</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aviarium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 5, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cupae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomen,</span>”
				<i>very short</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 4, 2, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">villa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 14, 13, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistola,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Q.
					Fr. 3, 1, 4</span></i>
			.— 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Of persons: meretrix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Poen. 2, 50</span></i>
			.</div>
